<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak NBS 3-mo bill yield unchanged at 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak NBS 3-mo bill yield unchanged at 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday the yield in its auction of three month liquidity bills was 9.3 percent, unchanged from the last successful auction of similar bills on August 21.</p>
<p>The NBS said in a statement that bids totalling 150 million crowns were received, of which 50 million crowns were accepted.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
